# Architecture

## Layout

| Area | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Gateway | `packages/ctrl-a` | Bun HTTP/WS daemon |
| Protocol | `packages/ctrl-s` | Zod schemas, events, OpenAPI |
| Runtimes | `packages/ctrl-r` | ModelProvider adapters |
| Memory | `packages/ctrl-z` | SQLite + migrations |
| Agent | `packages/ctrl-x` | Loop, tools, context |
| MCP | `packages/ctrl-m` | stdio JSON-RPC client |
| Knowledge | `packages/ctrl-k` | FTS / vector / hybrid search |
| Channels | `packages/ctrl-c` | Webhook, Telegram, Discord, Slack |
| Client | `packages/ctrl-i` | Typed gateway client |
| Contracts | `packages/ctrl-t` | Contract tests |
| Desktop | `apps/desktop` | Electron shell |
| Mobile | `apps/mobile` | Expo Android |
| Web | `apps/web` | Expo PWA |
| CLI | `apps/cli` | `@involvex/ctrl-f5` |

## Principles

- **Local-first:** identity and transcripts on clients; gateway optional for basic chat
- **Gateway as home node:** tools, MCP, channels, backups live on the gateway
- **Process boundary:** gateway is an independent Bun process; desktop starts/manages it
- **Clients** talk HTTP/WebSocket only — never sync SQLite peer-to-peer
- **Provider abstraction:** all LLMs through `ModelProvider` in `ctrl-r`
- **Message sync:** append-only; notes/memory last-write-wins with tombstones when reachable

## API / type contracts

- Shared shapes live in `@involvex/ctrl-s` (Zod), not ad-hoc DTOs
- Validate every process/IPC/network boundary with Zod
- Prefer typed client in `@involvex/ctrl-i` over raw fetch

## Workspaces

- Bun workspaces only (not npm/yarn/pnpm)
- No shared ESLint/Prettier config — Bun-native lint/format
- Package builds: `bun run build:packages` / per-package `build:ctrl-*`
